{"synopsis":"Setelah bereinkarnasi ke Benua Tianwu, Ye Yun mengaktifkan Multiverse Devouring System dan menerima hadiah jutaan kali kecepatan serangan dalam paket hadiah pemula. Sejak saat itu, dia menjadi pembangkit tenaga listrik yang tak terkalahkan! Seperti kata pepatah, dalam dunia seni bela diri, kecepatan adalah yang terpenting. Apakah Anda pikir saya hanya mengupil dan membersihkan telinga saya? Faktanya, saya baru saja mengeksekusi tiga puluh lima ribu orang dengan satu serangan pedang dan delapan puluh tujuh ribu orang dengan satu ayunan pedang, sambil juga melepaskan berbagai teknik tinju dan seni rahasia.","alternative_title":"1 Million Times Attack Speed","author":"猫三月文化","artist":"], 猫三月文化 [Add","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"c5d9d333-2555-4a1a-a682-ef707790dcce","number":"105","chapter":"105","title":"","date":"2025-04-20","released":"2025-04-20"},{"chapter_id":"36b57615-acfa-4eb7-a8e5-a6d3afbafdb6","number":"104","chapter":"104","title":"","date":"2025-04-03","released":"2025-04-03"},{"chapter_id":"e01c594c-db02-4117-a6aa-14fa1f2ee9a1","number":"103","chapter":"103","title":"","date":"2025-03-11","released":"2025-03-11"},{"chapter_id":"bdc5c9c4-dbe6-476b-8ae3-a9a2763e6264","number":"102","chapter":"102","title":"","date":"2025-03-11","released":"2025-03-11"},{"chapter_id":"1a046b2b-893a-401a-bd01-191f376cb50b","number":"101","chapter":"101","title":"","date":"2025-03-11","released":"2025-03-11"},{"chapter_id":"fb8c1468-6b0c-4df0-aaaa-1dd61049ee9b","number":"100","chapter":"100","title":"","date":"2025-03-11","released":"2025-03-11"},{"chapter_id":"171bfc65-c55c-4b59-bcca-c90920d50241","number":"99","chapter":"99","title":"","date":"2025-03-11","released":"2025-03-11"},{"chapter_id":"eeb17b1c-9f64-4d54-9b73-a7ada2f102ba","number":"98","chapter":"98","title":"","date":"2025-03-11","released":"2025-03-11"},{"chapter_id":"2915c02a-b8ce-44b0-9add-71bb8c02fdde","number":"97","chapter":"97","title":"","date":"2025-03-11","released":"2025-03-11"},{"chapter_id":"